COPY_EXISTING ~C0BDDHL.spl~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~Millenia of Deathly Stillness~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Millenia of Deathly Stillness
This is a powerful aid to both the Darkbloom Bard and to <PRO_HISHER> allies. This song gives the Darkbloom Bard <PRO_HIMHER>self regeneration for 10% of <PRO_HISHER> maximum hit points per round and increases <PRO_HISHER> allies' arcane casting level by 3 and casting speed by 1. Enemies within range have their Magic Resistance reduced by 50 percentage points and must make a Save vs. Spell at -6 or be Silenced.

This ability replaces the current Bard Song.~

ADD_PROJECTILE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/C0BDD#1.PRO~ ~Dark Entanglement~
ADD_PROJECTILE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/C0BDD#SO.PRO~ ~Bard Song Ignore Caster~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/C0BDD#SO.spl~ ~override~
READ_LONG 0x64 "abil_off"
READ_SHORT 0x68 "abil_num"
SET "delta" = 0
FOR (index = 0; index < abil_num; index = index + 1) BEGIN
WRITE_SHORT (%abil_off% + (0x28 * %index%) + 0x26) ~%C0BDD#SO%~
END
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/C0BDD#1.spl~ ~override~
READ_LONG 0x64 "abil_off"
READ_SHORT 0x68 "abil_num"
SET "delta" = 0
FOR (index = 0; index < abil_num; index = index + 1) BEGIN
WRITE_SHORT (%abil_off% + (0x28 * %index%) + 0x26) ~%C0BDD#1%~
END
SAY NAME1 ~Dark Entanglement~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Dark Entanglement
By means of this spell, the caster is able to cause dark plants and roots in the area of effect to entangle creatures within the area for five rounds. An entangled creature can still attack but receives a -2 penalty to its Armor Class and -10% to Magic Resistance. There is 10% chance upon entanglement that the creature will be poisoned and suffer 1 damage per second for 5 seconds.~

// Apply after the final bundled-resource copies and projectile rewrites.
INCLUDE ~%MOD_FOLDER%/lib/darkbloom_balance.tpa~

// Druidic spells. SPELL.IDS names the intended spell: Spell Revisions,
// IWDification and IWD:EE keep spells in different SPPRxxx files, so a fixed
// filename can copy an unrelated spell (Spell Revisions' SPPR112 is Strength
// of Stone). When the installation lacks a spell, the bundled IWD version is
// installed under Darkbloom's own resrefs, so no installed spell, icon, item,
// projectile, visual effect or sub-spell is replaced.
// Curse
LAF C0_BW_IMPORT_PRIEST_SPELL
  INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 1 required = 0
  STR_VAR symbol = ~CLERIC_CURSE~ destination = ~C0BDDS1~ label = ~Curse~
  RET imported
END
ACTION_IF NOT imported BEGIN
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR112B.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS1B.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR112C.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS1C.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/AREA1X.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDA1.BAM~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/#BLESS.VVC~ ~override/C0BDDV1.VVC~
  LPF C0_BW_REPLACE_RESREF INT_VAR offset = 0x08
    STR_VAR expected = ~AREA1X~ resref = ~C0BDDA1~ label = ~Curse visual effect~ END
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/IDPRO237.PRO~ ~override/C0BDDP1.PRO~
  LPF C0_BW_REPLACE_RESREF INT_VAR offset = 0x21c
    STR_VAR expected = ~#BLESS~ resref = ~C0BDDV1~ label = ~Curse projectile~ END
ADD_PROJECTILE ~override/C0BDDP1.PRO~ ~Darkbloom Curse~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR112.SPL~ ~override/C0BDDS1.SPL~
  LPF C0_BW_SPL_PRIVATE_FALLBACK
    INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 1 projectile = C0BDDP1
    STR_VAR identity = ~SPPR112~ destination = ~C0BDDS1~ label = ~Curse~
  END
  LPF ALTER_EFFECT
    INT_VAR
      match_opcode = 139 // display string
 parameter1 = RESOLVE_STR_REF (~Cursed~)
END
SAY NAME1 ~Curse~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Curse
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 1
Sphere: All
Range: Visual range of the caster
Duration: 6 rounds
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When uttering the Curse spell, the caster lowers the morale of enemy creatures and any Saving Throws and attack rolls they make by 1. At the instant the spell is completed, it affects all creatures in a 15-ft. radius centered on the point selected by the caster. Affected creatures leaving the area are still subject to the spell's effect; those entering the area after the casting is completed are not.~
END
// Beast Claw
LAF C0_BW_IMPORT_PRIEST_SPELL
  INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 2 required = 0
  STR_VAR symbol = ~CLERIC_BEAST_CLAW~ destination = ~C0BDDS2~ label = ~Beast Claw~
  RET imported
END
ACTION_IF NOT imported BEGIN
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR219B.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS2B.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR219C.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS2C.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/IBCLAW.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS2I.BAM~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/BCLAW.ITM~ ~override/C0BDDS2W.ITM~
  LPF C0_BW_REPLACE_RESREF INT_VAR offset = 0x3a
    STR_VAR expected = ~IBCLAW~ resref = ~C0BDDS2I~ label = ~Beast Claw weapon~ END
  READ_LONG 0x64 c0_claw_abilities
  READ_SHORT 0x68 c0_claw_count
  FOR (c0_claw_i = 0; c0_claw_i < c0_claw_count; ++c0_claw_i) BEGIN
    LPF C0_BW_REPLACE_RESREF INT_VAR offset = (c0_claw_abilities + 0x38 * c0_claw_i + 0x04)
      STR_VAR expected = ~IBCLAW~ resref = ~C0BDDS2I~ label = ~Beast Claw weapon~ END
  END
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR219.SPL~ ~override/C0BDDS2.SPL~
  LPF C0_BW_SPL_PRIVATE_FALLBACK
    INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 2
    STR_VAR identity = ~SPPR219~ destination = ~C0BDDS2~ label = ~Beast Claw~
  END
  LPF ALTER_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 111 // create weapon
    STR_VAR match_resource = ~BCLAW~ resource = ~C0BDDS2W~ END
SAY NAME1 ~Beast Claw~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Beast Claw
(Alteration)

Level: 2
Sphere: Combat
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transforms the caster's arms into the claws of a mighty beast, giving the caster 18/72 Strength and the ability to rake an opponent for 2d4 (plus Strength bonus) points of slashing damage. The caster can attack twice per round with the beast claws, with a +2 bonus to hit.~
END
// Mold Touch
LAF C0_BW_IMPORT_PRIEST_SPELL
  INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 3 required = 0
  STR_VAR symbol = ~CLERIC_MOLD_TOUCH~ destination = ~C0BDDS3~ label = ~Mold Touch~
  RET imported
END
ACTION_IF NOT imported BEGIN
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR326B.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS3B.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR326C.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDS3C.BAM~
     ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/MTOUCHH.BAM~ ~override/C0BDDA3.BAM~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/MTOUCHH.VVC~ ~override/C0BDDV3.VVC~
  LPF C0_BW_REPLACE_RESREF INT_VAR offset = 0x08
    STR_VAR expected = ~MTOUCHH~ resref = ~C0BDDA3~ label = ~Mold Touch visual effect~ END
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/idmold.PRO~ ~override/C0BDDP3.PRO~
ADD_PROJECTILE ~override/C0BDDP3.PRO~ ~Darkbloom Mold Touch~
// Each opcode-78 tick applies this sub-spell, which spreads the mold.
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/sppr326b.SPL~ ~override/C0BDDS3B.SPL~
  LPF C0_BW_SPL_PRIVATE_FALLBACK
    INT_VAR projectile = C0BDDP3
    STR_VAR identity = ~SPPR326B~ destination = ~C0BDDS3B~ subspell = ~C0BDDS3B~ label = ~Mold Touch sub-spell~
  END
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/darkbloom/BGEE/SPPR326.SPL~ ~override/C0BDDS3.SPL~
  LPF C0_BW_SPL_PRIVATE_FALLBACK
    INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 3
    STR_VAR identity = ~SPPR326~ destination = ~C0BDDS3~ subspell = ~C0BDDS3B~ label = ~Mold Touch~
  END
  LPF ALTER_EFFECT INT_VAR match_opcode = 215 // play visual effect
    STR_VAR match_resource = ~MTOUCHH~ resource = ~C0BDDV3~ END
SAY NAME1 ~Mold Touch~
SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC ~Mold Touch
(Alteration)

Level: 3
Sphere: Plant
Range: Touch
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 10-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell infects the creature the caster touches with a rapidly spreading brown mold. If the infected creature fails a Save vs. Spell, the infection is severe and the creature takes magic damage as follows:

1st round: 4d6 damage
2nd round: 3d6 damage
3rd round: 2d6 damage
4th round: 1d6 damage

If the Saving Throw is successful, the damage is reduced as follows:

1st round: 2d6 damage
2nd round: 1d6 damage
3rd round: 1d6 damage

Each round after the first, the nearest creature within 10 ft. of the victim must make a Save vs. Spell or be infected by the mold at full strength. This process continues until the mold fails to infect a suitable host in time. Creatures already under the effects of the mold cannot contract it again. The brown mold quickly dies once the spell expires.~
END
// Thorn Spray
LAF C0_BW_IMPORT_PRIEST_SPELL
  INT_VAR spell_type = 1 spell_level = 4 required = 0
  STR_VAR symbol = ~CLERIC_THORN_SPRAY~ destination = ~C0BDDS4~ label = ~Thorn Spray~
  RET imported
